        "quote": "The governing and administrative body of the authority shall be a board consisting of seven (7) members, to be known as the transit board. Members of the board shall be residents of the metropolitan area and individuals of recognized business ability.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a9-18:block:0#text",
